<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose">
    <p>Hightide was created by José Paralta, a former surf camp owner and developer, with support from a small group of friends and collaborators who share a passion for surfing, travel, and independent businesses.</p>
    <p>Frustrated by clunky and overpriced booking tools, José started building something simpler and more flexible. Hightide is the result — a tool designed for small operators by someone who understands their everyday challenges.</p>
  </div>
</section>

