<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose">
    <h2>We want to build tools that people love to use</h2>
    <p>Our goal is to support people who have turned their passion into a business by giving them simple and powerful tools to manage their work and share what they love with others.</p>
    <h2>Let's do our part to level the playing field</h2>
    <p>The tourism world is dominated by large platforms, but it's the small, independent operators who create the most authentic experiences. Hightide exists to support them, helping them grow on their own terms and connect directly with their customers.</p>
    <p>Hightide is a small, bootstrapped company focused on quality over speed. We care about building a product we're proud of and keeping our relationships respectful and supportive as we grow.</p>
  </div>
</section>

